">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.540" end="00:30.940"><span begin="00:28.540" end="00:29.050">You </span><span begin="00:29.050" end="00:29.320">had </span><span begin="00:29.320" end="00:29.470">to </span><span begin="00:29.470" end="00:30.940">leave</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.000" end="00:33.670"><span begin="00:31.000" end="00:31.210">And </span><span begin="00:31.210" end="00:31.600">that's </span><span begin="00:31.600" end="00:31.960">all </span><span begin="00:31.960" end="00:32.140">I </span><span begin="00:32.140" end="00:32.350">can </span><span begin="00:32.350" end="00:33.670">see</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.820" end="00:39.040"><span begin="00:33.820" end="00:34.210">But </span><span begin="00:34.210" end="00:34.390">you </span><span begin="00:34.390" end="00:34.930">told </span><span begin="00:34.930" end="00:35.290">me </span><span begin="00:35.290" end="00:35.470">your </span><span begin="00:35.470" end="00:36.820">love </span><span begin="00:36.820" end="00:37.030">was </span><span begin="00:37.030" end="00:39.040">blind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.270" end="00:43.420"><span begin="00:40.270" end="00:41.110">There </span><span begin="00:41.110" end="00:41.650">are </span><span begin="00:41.650" end="00:43.420">times</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.450" end="00:50.770"><span begin="00:43.450" end="00:43.750">You're </span><span begin="00:43.750" end="00:44.320">so </span><span begin="00:44.320" end="00:45.700">impossible </span><span begin="00:45.700" end="00:46.090">that </span><span begin="00:46.090" end="00:46.600">I </span><span begin="00:46.600" end="00:47.350">should </span><span begin="00:47.350" end="00:48.310">sign </span><span begin="00:48.310" end="00:48.370">a </span><span begin="00:48.370" end="00:50.770">waiver</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.460" end="00:54.790"><span begin="00:51.460" end="00:51.790">And </span><span begin="00:51.790" end="00:52.480">you </span><